{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An introverted cosplayer, Koromo Kuroi, is flung into a fantasy world?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dreams of opening her very own costume shop, she sets out on a quest to earn enough money to turn that dream into reality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591400/extras/bacdf9d443e6a0e4582c262c1aa5e94e.avif?t=1767751445\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shy, slightly negative-thinking lead of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koromo is always second-guessing herself\u2014constantly wondering if someone like her is really cut out for anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passionate about cosplay but socially awkward, she has never shown her costumes to anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep down, she longs for friends who share her love of anime and cosplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She crafts all her costumes herself, with such skill that even the residents of her new world commend her craftsmanship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too nervous to chat with a hairdresser, she cuts her own hair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend cosplayers in an isekai setting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a tavern waitress in a 2D JRPG world to fund your dream clothing shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ minutes of gameplay </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591400?t=1767751445","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591400/fc93bc0269ccc1047e8754f33a981b486b96cb2f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767751445","capsule_image":"https://sha